# Copy to .env — get values from https://supabase.com dashboard → Project Settings → API
# URL은 경로 없이 프로젝트 루트만 (https://xxxx.supabase.co)
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=

# 토스페이먼츠 결제위젯 (payments-toss-plan.md §3). Only read when TOSS_ENABLED is flipped in
# src/lib/toss.ts — leaving these blank keeps today's simulated payment path.
# CLIENT key only: public by design, it authorizes nothing. The SECRET key belongs to the server
# (`supabase secrets set TOSS_SECRET_KEY=...`, Sean only) and must NEVER appear in this file.
# VARIANT selects which 결제위젯 config renders — the 카드+간편결제-only restriction (no 가상계좌)
# is a 개발자센터 setting on that variant, not a client parameter. Blank = default variant.
# Toss's PUBLIC docs demo key (published in docs.tosspayments.com — safe to commit, charges
# nothing). Enough for the A3 device spike + widget sandbox with variantKey DEFAULT; the
# 카드+간편결제-only variant and billing(자동결제) TEST keys still require our own dashboard
# keys (payments-toss-plan.md §5-1b note).
EXPO_PUBLIC_TOSS_CLIENT_KEY=test_gck_docs_Ovk5rk1EwkEbP0W43n07xlzm
EXPO_PUBLIC_TOSS_VARIANT_KEY=DEFAULT

# ── SECURITY RULE (cso audit 2026-08-19) ────────────────────────────────────────────
# NEVER put SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY (or any privileged key) in app/.env or anywhere under app/.
# Expo tooling reads app/.env; a service-role key one EXPO_PUBLIC_ rename away from the bundle is
# a full-RLS-bypass credential in a client artifact. Ops scripts (seed-route-traces, e2e-club)
# read ~/.config/daengrun/ops.env (chmod 600) or $DAENGRUN_OPS_ENV — outside the repo on purpose.
